24. Having heard the respective counsel, this Court framed the following issues/ points for consideration;
1) Whether the building permission given in favour of the Petitioners on 18.01.2018 is sustainable?
2) Whether the rejection of BPS applications made by the Petitioners on 14.11.2019 by Respondent No.2 is within the scope of the A.P. Municipal Corporations Act, 1955?
